menu "Affine ESP32-S3 agent"
config AFFINE_AGENT_LOG_CDC
    bool "Mirror logs to a second CDC interface (test builds only)"
    default n
    depends on TINYUSB_CDC_COUNT >= 2
    help
        For boards whose USB-UART port cannot be connected together with the
        native port. Interface 0 stays the Uni protocol channel; logs are
        mirrored to CDC interface 1, and still go to UART0. Lines are dropped
        while no host drains them. Build with sdkconfig.logcdc.
endmenu
